NAME "Markdown Code Block and Syntax Highlighting Alignment (1.5.7)"
WINDOW 100 30
TARGET both

# Turn 1: Emit markdown code block with language specifier and inline backticks
MOCK_TURN
  THOUGHT "Formatting code snippet with syntax highlighting..." TOKENS 120 DELAY 100ms
  TEXT "Here is a sample Go function:\n\n```go\nfunc add(a, b int) int {\n\treturn a + b\n}\n```\n\nUse `add(1, 2)` to call it."
  USAGE PROMPT 18200 CANDIDATES 45 THOUGHTS 120
  FINISH STOP

BOOT_BOTH
WAIT_READY 10s

TYPE "show code"
ENTER

WAIT_TEXT "Use add(1, 2)" 15s
SNAPSHOT "01_markdown_codeblock"

DIFF
CLEANUP
